sn’t the type who can turn down a request."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c50105"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舜の幼なじみで、コンドミニアムを経営している家の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不治の病を患っており、人生を半ば諦めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不良っぽくありたいと願うものの、頼まれると断れない性格で、風紀委員を務めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14031","sourceWorkId":"23994","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"舜的青梅竹马，房产经营者的独生女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"患有不治之症，对人生绝望了一半。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然想走上不良之路，但却是个不会拒绝别人请求的风纪委员。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46957"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bde021c26babe236395d441f0e15cd376b38353857df141a3b4c94df91557fc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f5964f175165886986e62e5537efd8b1f3ad82d8799d32192cc39a3c0a6fbce.webp","width":93,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ふじたまみ","creatorId":"vndb:s7951","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7951","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7951","name":"ふじた まみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:186677:46957:23302:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"八ッ橋 しなもん","creatorId":"vndb:s11591","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11591","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11591","name":"八ッ橋しなもん(朔白)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:70044","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c50106","characterName":"紬木 沙羅","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46958","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"186677"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14032"],"vndbCharacterId":"c50106"},"originalCharacterName":"紬木 沙羅","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"revi